@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFEFE
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam shadowing false
title How one issue's scores are forged: the exam analogy
package "Paper prep (private, locked)" #FADBD8 {
  [Real historical events\nrewound to pre-reveal] as kase
  [Rubric frozen in advance\noracle self-scores] as oracle
}
package "Exam room (clean room)" #D6EAF8 {
  [Candidate enters\nno outside help = no fallback] as exam
  [Full proctoring record\nper-paper wire audit vs state.db] as monitor
  [Closing gate\nzero pollution or nothing passes] as gate
}
package "Publish (redacted)" #D5F5E3 {
  [Alias A-xxxxxxxx\n+ bundle hash] as aliasx
  [Result repo\nscores / aggregates / verdicts] as pub
}
package "Anyone" #FDEBD0 {
  [Check against the public hash index\nlibrary unswapped, scores reconcile] as verify
}
kase --> exam : only the info available at the time
oracle ..> gate : rescored independently after closing
exam --> monitor : every paper leaves a trace
monitor --> gate : closing check
gate --> aliasx : passing results redacted
aliasx --> pub : one issue per term
pub --> verify : readers verify hands-on
note bottom of oracle : questions / oracle / transcripts never go public
note bottom of exam : the brain is who it is\na substitute call voids the whole paper
@enduml
